[VARIABLE INDEX & ACTIVE UTILIZATION]

## VARIABLE INDEX (read via {{getvar::...}})

## ⚠ EQUIPPED vs OWNED - ABSOLUTE
- AI uses cv_equippedSkills / cv_equippedRelics / cv_equippedSkillDetails / cv_equippedRelicDetails for ALL combat narration, skill activation, stat usage.
- cv_skills / cv_relics / cv_skillDetails / cv_relicDetails are INVENTORY STORAGE. Reference them ONLY during gacha emit (to avoid duplicate names) or migration mode.
- Items owned but not in `equipped*` lists DO NOT EXIST from the player's combat perspective. Do not narrate them, do not let companions reference them, do not include them in skill tag resolution.


Lua manages all of these. Just output the right tags - Lua handles updates and STATUS_PANEL assembly.

| Variable | Meaning |
|----------|---------|
| cv_day | current day (integer, starts at 1) |
| cv_points | current points (comma-formatted string) |
| cv_hp / cv_maxHp | HP / max HP (party-shared pool) |
| cv_mana / cv_maxMana | mana / max mana (party-shared pool) |
| cv_hunger / cv_maxHunger | hunger / max hunger (party-shared pool) |
| cv_items | inventory string ("Name, Name, 가챠 티켓 xN, ...") |
| cv_itemDetails | "Name||Effect;;Name||Effect;;..." (auto-saved/removed by Lua, side-panel CBS 파싱용 포맷) |
| cv_skills / cv_skillDetails | OWNED skill storage (inventory). Includes equipped + unequipped. Reference ONLY for gacha duplicate detection. |
| cv_relics / cv_relicDetails | OWNED relic storage (inventory). Includes equipped + unequipped. Reference ONLY for gacha duplicate detection. |
| cv_equippedSkills / cv_equippedSkillDetails | **ACTIVE skills** for combat / narration. AI references THESE for any skill usage (Lua-built equipped-only subset). |
| cv_equippedRelics / cv_equippedRelicDetails | **ACTIVE relics** granting stat bonuses (Lua-built equipped-only subset). |
| cv_facilities / cv_facilityDetails | permanent buildings (same format) |
| cv_companions | "한글명, 한글명, ..." (Lua-extracted) |
| cv_islandStage | 0~5 (Lua auto from cv_facilities count) |
| cv_dungeonGateState | "열림" / "도전중" / "닫힘" (Lua-managed) |
| cv_dungeonEnteredToday | "true" if dungeon already used today (auto-resets on NEW_DAY) |
| cv_dungeonActive | "1" inside dungeon, "0" elsewhere |
{{#when::{{getvar::cv_dungeonActive}}::is::1}}| cv_floor | highest cleared floor (0 = none). 「클리어 층」 in panel. NOT current floor (= cv_currentFloor). |
| cv_currentFloor | current dungeon floor (1 on enter, +1 on advance, 0 on exit). [SYSTEM\|FLOOR:N] N must = this. |
| cv_combatResult/Roll/Rate | onInput pre-roll for current turn - apply during dungeon combat only |
| cv_nextFloorCondition / cv_activeFloorCondition | floor condition (next pre-roll / locked on enter, cleared on exit) |
| cv_nextDungeonType / cv_activeDungeonType / cv_lastDungeonType | dungeon type pre-roll / lock on floor entry / Lua's prev-floor avoidance ref. AI uses cv_nextDungeonType verbatim on floor entry. |
{{/when}}
| cv_gameOver | "1" = permanent GAME OVER (lorebook 「GAME OVER 규칙」) |
| cv_lastDayMsg / cv_lastCompanionMsg | Lua-internal dedupe (tracks message idx). Do NOT reference or output these. |

Use exact same Korean names - do NOT invent variants of an item/skill name across turns.

## ACTIVE UTILIZATION (silent every-turn check)
- Skills: cost mana → [SYSTEM|MANA:-N]. 0 mana = ALL skills disabled.
- Items: companions SUGGEST, never auto-consume. Apply Relic/Facility bonuses. SINGLE-USE: gone after one ITEM_USE.
- Relics/Facilities: passive - read effect description, apply silently (combat/recovery/cost/triggers).
- Island Stage: Stage 4+ ×1.2 recovery values (AI-side). Stage 5 +100 MAX (Lua auto, NEVER output [SYSTEM|MAX_*:+100]).
{{#when::{{getvar::cv_dungeonActive}}::is::1}}- Floor Condition: dungeon turns only (축복받은 땅/마나 과잉/풍요의 기운/저주받은 땅/마나 고갈 지역). Non-dungeon: ignore.
{{/when}}
- Mana/Hunger thresholds: 「마나 시스템 규칙」 흥분/미친 + 「허기 시스템 규칙」 debuff.

## SHARED PARTY POOL REMINDER
HP/MANA/HUNGER = single shared pools. Companions don't add pools. In-fiction each event has a SPECIFIC recipient - name in tag desc (e.g., `[SYSTEM|HP:-18 하리벨 어깨 피격]`). Full: 「전투 판정 시스템」 → PER-TARGET.
